class_name Inspirations
extends RefCounted
## The classic games that inspired each game of the Arcade (by the game's "arg"): original name,
## authors/publisher and year, a short history and the Wikipedia page. The names are trademarks of
## their owners; this project has no connection to them. The stories are translated
## by I18n; "wiki" is the English page, "wiki_pt" and "wiki_es" the pages for the other languages.

